#ASSERT `s 119(1)(b) the Commissioner's duty to summon the party against whom the claim is made has arisen` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- The memorandum or verbal claim is not received (ruling (b)). (re-read from the text on 2026-11-05; the expected value was NOTHING)
#ASSERT `s 119(1)(b) the Commissioner's duty to summon the party against whom the claim is made has arisen` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 119(1)(b) the Commissioner's duty to summon the party against whom the claim is made has arisen` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
