#ASSERT `s 119(1)(b) the Commissioner must also notify or summon the person whose interests appear likely to be affected` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 119(1)(c) the Commissioner may summon the witness` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
