-- The penalty is s 112's, first or subsequent; here the caller's two answers are a fine up to $1,000 and one up to $2,000.
GIVETH A `Penalty on conviction`
`ea3 test penalty of at most 1000 dollars` MEANS
    `Penalty on conviction` WITH
        `least fine in dollars` IS 0
        `greatest fine in dollars` IS JUST 1000
        `longest imprisonment in months` IS NOTHING

GIVETH A `Penalty on conviction`
`ea3 test penalty of at most 2000 dollars` MEANS
    `Penalty on conviction` WITH
        `least fine in dollars` IS 0
        `greatest fine in dollars` IS JUST 2000
        `longest imprisonment in months` IS JUST 6

#ASSERT `s 124(2) the penalty for the offence` (JUST `ea3 test penalty of at most 1000 dollars`) (JUST `ea3 test penalty of at most 2000 dollars`) FALSE EQUALS JUST `ea3 test penalty of at most 1000 dollars`
